{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >### Wishlist Progress</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >13399 / 15000 [\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2591\u2591\u2591] 89%<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2111430/extras/6b0b4f5c1e8f79532fe5a20e066f5753.avif?t=1760302965\" width=616 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>With the approval of the  Pompasaur &gt;&gt;&gt; Inspired by Gnarled hag</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inspired by Gnarled Hag and Granny. You play as a girl who needs to escape from an old dilapidated house where a scary old man lives.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hide from him</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2111430/extras/83bf91a951970cf784a1295fba28d00b.poster.avif?t=1760302965\" width=800 height=362 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2111430/extras/83bf91a951970cf784a1295fba28d00b.webm?t=1760302965\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2111430/extras/83bf91a951970cf784a1295fba28d00b.mp4?t=1760302965\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hide behind boxes, crates, a sofa, look for a way out, but most importantly, don't make noise. Otherwise, he will notice you. You don't want him to catch you, do you?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Run from him</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2111430/extras/247e9f732c4dc17cb5e626faf7a5d374.poster.avif?t=1760302965\" width=800 height=362 ><source src=\"https://shared